    "`node desktop/scripts/tokens.mjs` writes desktop/src/renderer/tokens.css (the Electron app's",
    "custom properties and Tailwind theme) and native/crates/app/src/tokens.rs (the native app's",
    "palettes and scales). Change a value here, run it, and commit all three.",
    "",
    "The direction is a quiet one, after macOS: a neutral window with the chrome either side a",
    "tint of it, hairlines instead of boxes, flat panels, one accent, and shadows only under what",
    "floats. A colour is #rrggbb, or #rrggbb/alpha. Light lists only what differs from dark."
